# An OpenCode chat handed to Claude mid-way: the "Context handoff" line where the new session took over.
stage 1440 900
window 1440 900
project storefront shop
chat Ada opencode opencode/big-pickle
say "hi"
settle 14
core handOff {"agentId":"$chat","provider":"claude"}
settle 4
say "Sketch the orders table"
settle 10
snap context-handoff
